Fri Nov 13 14:25:57 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add t1lib-5.1.2-searchpath-overflow.patch: intT1_GetFileSearchPath()
  from t1lib-5.1.2-segfault.patch always wrote a NUL at offset 900 of
  the search path string, overflowing the heap once per FontDataBase
  entry; with ~25 fonts T1_InitLib() aborts (Mowitz/Siag Office)
- Build with -std=gnu17 on Leap 16.0 too (suse_version 1600 has
  GCC 15, whose C23 default rejects the K&R code)

